L('reply','agree',Y,F,[("Tell the governor yes.","glad")])
L('reply','ask',Y,F,[("What comes with it, and who would I answer to?","guarded")])
L('reply','decline',Y,F,[("I'll pass. My district sent me to do a job, and I'm not done.","calm")])
