L('reply','tell',Y,F,[("I voted for it, and I'll own that. But I want to hear what it's doing to you before I defend it.","calm")])
L('reply','confront',Y,F,[("You're yelling at me in a parking lot. That's not going to change a vote.","braced")])
L('reply','offer',Y,F,[("Come to the next council meeting. I'll make sure you get the floor before anyone else.","calm")])
L('reply','leave',Y,F,[("I hear you. I'm late, and I won't do this justice standing here.","guarded")])
